# Battle System (BATT)
1. Battle UI(@11567109872507702583)
	1. Support battles w/ variable numbers of combatants.(@3572361621919980806)
	2. Display info about each actor.(@6346666021234991632)
		1. Name, Hp, Current element.(@2853532521296875199)
		2. Status effects.(@16487342674427999367)
		3. Stat Changes.(@4990075521729990646)
	3. Allow player to select/deselect actions for each of their characters.(@16485887229983581996)
		1. Player selects an action for each actor, moving from right to left.(@13893437085453142112)
		2. Once an action is selected, UI automatically moves to next actor.(@18117927818103411362)
		3. The player has the option to select different actions for previous actors.(@2810703269950299967)
			1. This should not cause the game to forget any other selected actions (e.g. Alice chooses attack, then Bob chooses attack. If player goes back to change Alices action, this should not deselect Bobs action).(@1122450439457916221)
		4. View detailed info about things in battle.(@14903634935960503086)
			1. Show info about attacks when selected by player.(@6555783482266250750)
			2. Show info about items when selected by player.(@16833176933064244463)
			3. Show info about actors controlled by player.(@6469789126453551586)
			4. Show info about status conditions.(@5075124357433597779)
			5. Show debug info.(@8639032827776747037)
				1. Show info about stat changes (e.g. exact math).(@8046598774954698199)
				2. Show info about opponent's battle actors.(@6669910798575405418)
			5. Customizable opponent ai.(@763817318648242929)
				1. Simple difficulty controls.(@3535535316469217606)
				2. Allow for different NPCs to use different strategies.(@611690462904795703)
			6. Enable verbose logging for diagnostic purposes.(@5854952463303537748)
		2. Elemental System.(@16757349436550575563)
			1. Attack + Primary & Attack + Secondary transmutations.(@16147554132515372797)
			2. Primary + Secondary transmutations.(@17620284291255335798)
			3. Apply related side effects.(@14301256547258612795)
			4. Modify damage based on resistances/weaknesses.(@15374561585134094899)
		3. Attack effects.(@7029671350467911502)
			1. Play animations.(@13780736768744166406)
				1. Support both particle effects and other types of *animations*.(@10180930956102393617)
			2. Calculate and apply damage based on stats and resistances.(@9527863929149726693)
			3. Apply status effects, if applicable.(@12596813966548797135)
			4. Allow attacks to feature unique mechanics.(@12620800385948024038)
				5. Allow non-unique mechanics to be easily shared between attacks.(@16971263064959138765)
			5. Incur affinity/quantity costs on player.(@8018470864708076384)
		4. Status effects.(@6492301569768904463)
			1. Calculate and apply effects at end of turn.(@6508698152141963812)
			2. Remove expired status effects.(@1745469183734065153)
		5. Item effects/usage.(@9228490801500514809)
			1. Play animation.(@5801080165827534273)
			2. Apply effects to target(s).(@10244738836906453254)
			3. Remove from inventory.(@5042936279717307206)
3. Attack Builder.
